001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          STALINQS.
001300 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        APRIL 1988.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS. THIS IS THE RECEIVING SLIP INQUIRY PROGRAM.
001900*************************************************************
002000*************************************************************
002100**                    S T A L I N Q S                      **
002200**                                                         **
002300**    THIS IS THE SCREEN PROGRAM FOR THE TALLIN INQUIRY.   **
002400**                                                         **
002410**  A TALLY NUMBER IS ENTERED BY THE USER AND ALL OF THE   **
002420**  RELATED PURCHASE ORDERS ARE DISPLAYED.  ONE PURCHASE   **
002430**  ORDER MAY BE SELECTED OR ALL MAY BE SELECTED.  THE     **
002440**  ITEMS ARE DISPLAYED AS IN A RECEIVING SLIP INQUIRY.    **
002450*************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *C                  HISTORY OF CHANGES
      *C   11/22/93  JEFF BUNGO REQ #4502
      *C       ADDED PARM IN CALL TO SINQRSI.  PARM ADDED FOR
      *C       INQUIRIES TO HISTORY, THIS PROGRAM WILL ONLY INQUIRE
      *C       FROM LIVE DATABASE SO PARM SET TO SPACES.
      *C***********************************************************
002500
002600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZTALINQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

            SELECT DTALLY
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
003600 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
003700
       FD  DTALLY
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTALLY-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4700  OF MCFLCS4701.
003300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003400************************************************************
003500*            W O R K I N G   S T O R A G E                 *
003600************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1      PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2      PIC X.
       01  RELATIVE-RECNO         PIC 9(9).
003700 01  PASS-RCVR.
003710     05  FILLER      PIC X(11)  VALUE SPACES.
003720     05  PASS-RCVR1  PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
003800 01  SAVE-KEY        PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROES.
004100
004200 01  SAVE-MAIN-PO-ARG                  PIC X(14)  VALUE SPACES.
005400**************************************************************
005500*                 C A L L E D  R O U T I N E S               *
005600**************************************************************
005700 01  RETURN-CODE               PIC X(2)     VALUE "00".
005800*---------- VSETERROR AND VPUTWINDOW
005900 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
006000 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
006100     05  MSG-BUFFER            PIC X(68).
006200     05  MSG-VALUE             PIC X(8).
006300 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76 COMP-4.
006400 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0  COMP-4.
006500 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1  COMP-4.
006600
006700 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.
006800 01  SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS.
006900     05  PRINT-CTL             PIC S9(4)    COMP-4.
007000     05  PAGE-CTL              PIC S9(4)    COMP-4.
007100     05  SPOOLFIL-OPEN-SW      PIC X   VALUE "N".
007200
007300 01  PASS-SPOOL-PRT-NO         PIC S9(2)    COMP-4 VALUE ZEROES.
007500*---------  PARAMETERS FOR ALL INQUIRY SUBROUTINES (SINQRSI & SINQFRT)
007600 01  SUBROUTINE-PARMS.
007700     05  PASS-LAST-RECEIVER    PIC 999   VALUE ZEROES.
007800     05  PASS-START-RECEIVER   PIC 999   VALUE ZEROES.
007900     05  PASS-PO               PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.
008000     05  PASS-SPOOL            PIC S9(2) VALUE ZEROES COMP-4.
008010     05  PASS-REDEFINES-AREA.
008100         07  PASS-PLT-NUMBER     PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
008200         07  PASS-NO-LEFT-OFF-AT PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZEROES.
008210     05  TALLY-PASS-AREA REDEFINES PASS-REDEFINES-AREA.
008220         07  PASS-TALLY-ITEM     PIC X(4).
008230         07  FILLER              PIC X(2).
008300     05  PASS-INQUIRY          PIC X     VALUE "T".
008400     05  PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY     PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROES COMP-4.
           05  PASS-HISTORY-FLAG     PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
           05  PASS-ITEM             PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.

      *------ WS CONTROL AREA
       01  MAJOR-MINOR                 PIC XXXX.
       01  WS-CONTROL.
           02  FUNCTION-NUM            PIC XX.
                   88  EXIT-KEY-F8-USED                     VALUE "08". LVW000LS
                   88  REFRESH-KEY-F4-USED                  VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00". LVW000LS
                   88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01". LVW000LS
                   88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02". LVW000LS
                   88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03". LVW000LS
                   88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05". LVW000LS
                   88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06". LVW000LS
                   88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07". LVW000LS
                   88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08". LVW000LS
           02 FUN-KEY REDEFINES FUNCTION-NUM PIC XX.
           02 TERMINAL-ID PIC X(10).
           02 FORMAT-NAME PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS              PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND OCCURS 99 TIMES   PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.
010600
011500 01  TABLE-CONSTRAINTS.
011600     05  NUM-CODES-PER-SCREEN      PIC 9(2) VALUE 10.
011700     05  LINES-DESC-PER-CODE       PIC 9(1) VALUE 1.

008600*************************************************************
008700*                        D A T A B A S E                    *
008800*************************************************************
008900 COPY DBSTAT OF COPYLIB.
009000 COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.
009700 01  ARGUMENT-VALUES.
           05  TALLY-ARG             PIC X(4)     VALUE SPACES.
009900     05  PO-ARG.
009910         07  PO-ARG1           PIC X(11)    VALUE SPACES.
009920         07  PO-ARG2           PIC X(3)     VALUE SPACES.
010000 COPY DTALLY OF COPYLIB.
010200
010300 01  FORM-NAMES.
010400     05  TALLYINQ              PIC X(8)     VALUE "TALLYINQ".
010600
010700 01  SCREEN-TALLY-INQ.
            05  SCR-TALLY            PIC X(4).
            05  DE-COMMAND-LINE      PIC X(79).
            05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE      PIC X(79).
023600
       01  SUBFILE-CONTROL.
023800     05  SFC-TALLY                 PIC X(4).

       01  DE-SUBFILE.
024100     05  DE-SELECT-FLAG     PIC X(1).
024200     05  V-PO               PIC X(14).
024300     05  V-CODE             PIC X(7).
           05  V-ITEM             PIC X(4).
024900
010900 LINKAGE SECTION.
011000 01  BASE                 PIC X(10).
011100 COPY VCOMLINK OF COPYLIB.
011200 COPY LANGSUB OF COPYLIB.
011300
011400 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
011500 00-CONTROL.
011600
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT DTALLY.
011900     PERFORM 100-DISPLAY-MAIN-SCREEN  THRU 199-EXIT.
012000     CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, DTALLY.
012100     GOBACK.
013200 100-DISPLAY-MAIN-SCREEN.
013300     MOVE TALLYINQ   TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
013400     MOVE SPACES TO SCREEN-TALLY-INQ.
015400 105-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-TALLY-INQ TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-TALLY-INQ.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
034600
016700     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
016800         GO TO  199-EXIT.
016900
017300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2  OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1  OR
017400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8  OR
017500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4  OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 5  OR
017600        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6  OR
017700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
017800         MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
017900         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
018000         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
018100         PERFORM  940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
018200         GO TO  105-SHOW-FORM.
017310     MOVE SCR-TALLY TO TALLY-ARG, SFC-TALLY.

017400 110-FIND-TALLIES.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE TALLY-ARG TO TALLY OF DTALLY-REC.
           START DTALLY KEY = TALLY OF DTALLY-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
019000         MOVE 20 TO LANG-SETNUM
019100         MOVE 61 TO LANG-MSGNUM
019110         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
019130         PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
019140         GO TO 105-SHOW-FORM.
           PERFORM 810-CLEAR-SUBFILE THRU 819-EXIT.
           MOVE 0 TO RELATIVE-RECNO.
019300
       112-LOAD-RECEIVERS.
019400*----------  LOAD RECEIVERS
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DTALLY NEXT INTO BUF-DTALLY
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF TALLY OF DTALLY-REC NOT = TALLY-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
024900
           IF COND-WORD = 0
              MOVE DTAL-PO    TO V-PO
              MOVE DTAL-CODE  TO V-CODE
              MOVE DTAL-ITEM  TO V-ITEM
              MOVE SPACE      TO DE-SELECT-FLAG
              MOVE DE-SUBFILE TO DISPLAY-REC
              ADD 1 TO RELATIVE-RECNO
              WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
                    INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS
              GO TO 112-LOAD-RECEIVERS.
025000 125-GET-FORM2.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSB" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(76).
           IF RELATIVE-RECNO > ZERO
              MOVE B"1" TO IND(75)
           ELSE
              MOVE B"0" TO IND(75).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

038800 145-INQUIRE-DATA-ENTRY.
           READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                FORMAT "RDSF" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS
                AT END GO TO 100-DISPLAY-MAIN-SCREEN.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              GO TO 100-DISPLAY-MAIN-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DE-SUBFILE.
040100     IF DE-SELECT-FLAG = "X" AND V-PO > SPACES
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              GO TO 145-INQUIRE-DATA-ENTRY.

           MOVE SPACES TO DE-SELECT-FLAG.
           MOVE DE-SUBFILE TO DISPLAY-REC.
           REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
              INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

040600     MOVE V-PO              TO PASS-RCVR, PO-ARG.
040610     MOVE "000"             TO PO-ARG2.
040620     MOVE PO-ARG            TO PASS-PO.
040621     MOVE PASS-RCVR1        TO PASS-START-RECEIVER
                                     PASS-NO-LEFT-OFF-AT.
040622     MOVE V-ITEM            TO PASS-TALLY-ITEM.
           MOVE 1                 TO PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY.
       145-RS-INQUIRY.
           IF PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY = 1
040700       CALL "SINQRSI" USING  BASE,
041000                           VIEW-COMAREA,
041100                           SUBROUTINE-PARMS,
041200                           LANGUAGE-PARMS
           ELSE
             IF PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY = 2
040700         CALL "SINQFRT" USING  BASE,
041000                           VIEW-COMAREA,
041100                           SUBROUTINE-PARMS,
041200                           LANGUAGE-PARMS
             ELSE
               IF PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY = 2
040700           CALL "SINQRSIC" USING  BASE,
041000                           VIEW-COMAREA,
041100                           SUBROUTINE-PARMS,
041200                           LANGUAGE-PARMS
               END-IF
             END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF PASS-SAVE-LASTKEY = 1 OR 2 OR 4
               GO TO 145-RS-INQUIRY.
041210
041300     GO TO  145-INQUIRE-DATA-ENTRY.
041400
041500
041600 199-EXIT.  EXIT.
       810-CLEAR-SUBFILE.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND (75), IND (76).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (77).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND (77).
           MOVE ZERO TO RELATIVE-RECNO.
       819-EXIT.  EXIT.
042700******************************************************************
042800*   DISPLAY ERROR MESSAGE FOR SPECIFIC FIELD ON SCREEN           *
042900******************************************************************
043000 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.
044200 949-EXIT.  EXIT.
045200************************************************************
045300*                    B L O W U P                           *
045400*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
045500*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
045600*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
045700*                                                          *
045800*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
045900*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
046000*                                                          *
046100*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
046200************************************************************
046300 990-BLOWUP.
046400     MOVE "STALINQS"   TO BU-PGM-NAME.
046500     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
046600     MOVE PO-ARG      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
046800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
046900           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
047000           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
047100 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
047200
047300 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
048900 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
049000     EXIT.
